   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>演示可直接使用合成输入。若开展真实研究，应先准备以下资料；建议规模是项目起步规划，未宣称已采集这些数据。勾选只用于本页准备进度。</p><div class='research-prep'><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><b>真实应用数据准备清单</b><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>完整工序起止记录</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：建议每类不少于500次独立作业；属规划建议</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：统一时间戳，标记中断、等待、设备与井队</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>预测时点可用特征</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：保留截至每次预测时刻的井深、可观测阶段与进度</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：进度不得用实际总用时反推；不使用未来完工数据作为特征</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink-inv)' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>时间与井队留出集</span><span class='cl-s'>规模：按月份和井队保留至少20%完整工序</span></span><span class='cl-n'>标注与质量要求：评价MAE、区间覆盖率与宽度，删失记录单独处理</span></div></div></div>"
